Maka $q=-9\\left( 2 \\right)=-18$, sehingga $f\\left( x \\right)=2x-18$. Nilai $f\\left( 6 \\right)=2\\left( 6 \\right)-18=12-18=-6$.', 1, E'{"labels":["Benar","Salah"]}', 18, E'2026-10-20 07:25:55', E'2026-10-20 07:25:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
