Panjang AC =...A. $4$', E'Perhatikan $\\triangle BDA$: $\\tan 30^\\circ = \\frac{AD}{BD} \\implies AD = BD \\tan 30^\\circ = 3 \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{3} = \\sqrt{3}$.
![Gambar Soal](/media/r2/asesmen/word_20261023_191834_XqKbB8MIVwzh.jpeg)
Selanjutnya menentukan panjang $DC$ pada segitiga siku-siku $\\triangle ABC$: $AD \\times DC = BD^2 \\implies \\sqrt{3}(DC) = 3^2 \\implies DC = 3\\sqrt{3}$. Jadi, $AC = AD + DC = \\sqrt{3} + 3\\sqrt{3} = 4\\sqrt{3}$.', 2, E'{"labels":["Benar","Salah"]}', 2, E'2026-10-23 19:25:43', E'2026-10-23 19:25:43', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
